>> Product := Into okusha.
Product uma-kufika: ['a'] yenza: { :price
	Okuphumayo bhala: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product okusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Okuphumayo bhala: [' cent a piece.'].
Inombolo uma-kufika: ['X'] yenza: { :b
	b × uqobo.
}.
7 X { :i Okuphumayo bhala: i. }.
